 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">[3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">]</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; HEIGHT: 152.42pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 341.82pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 8.5pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 8.5pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">공통사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지도교수와 수강상담 및 승인을 받은 학생에 한하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수강변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">추가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">삭제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">타 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">타 학년 수강 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">여석이 있는 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학생본인이 전산으로 수강신청 가능(<u>학교 홈페이지 바로가기 서비스 \"학부수강신청</u>\")</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">여석이 없는 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">과목 이내</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">에서 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수강과목 변경신청서</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">해당강좌 교수님의 확인 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">종합학사행정실에 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이미 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수강신청한 과목 중 삭제할 과목은 학생 본인이 전산으로 삭제</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">하여야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학기초과생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">졸업학기생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">복수전공 및 부전공생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">교직이수생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">전과생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">편입생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수강신청기간 이후 복학생은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">과목 이상 변경 신청 가능</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">붙임: 수강신청 변경신청서 1부.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font color=\"#ff007f\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 수강과목 변경 신청서는 9월5일 ~ 7일(3일간) 10:00-17시&nbsp;종합학사행정실 학과 조교선생님께 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></font></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font color=\"#0055ff\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 2018-2학기 수강신청 후 휴학신청한 학생들의 수강신청 내역은 9.3(월) 수강신청 내역 삭제됨.&nbsp;</span></font></span></p><p><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
